            "id": "s1",
            "text": "What is the future for home security?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "The system will connect to a computer in your home."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "It will also connect to your TV and smartphone."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "A very small robot will watch everything."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "The security camera will see every room in the home."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "You won’t need many cameras."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "The system will know if something’s wrong."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "It will fix the problem."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "It will know if a new part is needed."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "It might even order it."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "The system will even sense poison gas or fire."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
